OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Ball's wedding surprise
OL,4,Aafter radio proposal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple whose surprise radio proposal
OL,7,Fcaptured hearts across the country were
OL,8,Fgiven an unforgettable wedding gift
OL,9,Fwhen singer and broadcaster Michael
OL,10,FBall turned up to perform at their
OL,11,Fceremony.
OL,13,FDawn Lloyd was shocked when her partner
OL,14,Fof more than 25 years Dave proposed on
OL,15,FBBC Radio 2's Love Letters programme in
OL,16,Fthe summer, and was stunned all over
OL,17,Fagain when Ball appeared at the
OL,18,Fcouple's wedding at Weston Hall in
OL,19,FStafford on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
