OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Ball's wedding surprise
OL,4,Aafter radio proposal
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had no inkling whatsoever that this
OL,7,Fwas going to happen," she said. "I was
OL,8,Fblown away.
OL,10,F"I just can't believe Dave has
OL,11,Fsurprised me like this a second time. I
OL,12,Fwas fooled the first time and now he
OL,13,Fhas got me again."
